that changed the game entirely. We're talking about the Bruin decision. For decades, courts used

01:18.240 --> 01:23.200
this kind of balancing act called means and scrutiny. You know, they'd weigh the government's

01:23.200 --> 01:28.160
interest in public safety against an individual's rights. Well, Bruin came along and just tossed

