that entire framework out the window. Now, the new and only test is based on just two things,

01:33.840 --> 01:38.080
the Constitution's text, and the nation's historical tradition of gun regulation.

01:38.640 --> 01:42.880
And you can really see the court's new thinking in this quote from Justice Thomas,

